## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design cross-region privacy-preserving data bridges, balancing tenant isolation, latency, and regulatory needs.

## Key Concepts
- Tenant isolation across regions
- Envelope encryption and KMS key management
- Cross-region data transfer with privacy-preserving aggregation
- Provenance and auditability
- Canary rollout and rollback strategies

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-code: envelope encrypt per-tenant data in-region
function encryptForTenant(data, tenantId, region) {
  const dataKey = kms.regional(region).generateDataKey(tenantId)
  const ciphertext = crypto.aes256GcmEncrypt(data, dataKey)
  const wrappedKey = kms(region).wrapKey(dataKey)
  return { ct: ciphertext, wk: wrappedKey, tenant: tenantId }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How to handle region failure and key rotation?
- How to measure privacy compliance and auditability during rollout?

